    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d14">

                <pb facs="0026" n="14" xml:id="pg14"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A4 Steering Committee/531: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-05-04T12:00:00+01:00">May 4, 1937—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received
                        May 4—9 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>35. Mr. Sandler informed me yesterday that he had instructed the Swedish Minister
                    at Bern to keep Mr. Wilson fully informed with respect to the subject of the
                    Department’s telegram No. 8, April 27, 6 p.m. Have advised Wilson.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
